<title>BELGIUM: Innogenetics to build 900 mln Bfr plant.</title>
<headline>Innogenetics to build 900 mln Bfr plant.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian Easdaq-listed biotechnology company Innogenetics said in a statement on Monday it had decided in principle to build a 900-million-franc production plant at Ghent, Belgium, which could create 140 jobs.</p>
<p>&quot;The company hopes to begin construction in September in order to meet the completion date of December 1998,&quot; Innogenetics said.</p>
<p>The company said the new factory was necessary to secure growth in U.S. sales.</p>
<p>-- Nick Antonovics, Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6817, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
